            "name": "content_hash",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "content_hash joins to DocHashIndex.content_hash. Not declared as a\n foreign-key type here — tacplus's record plane has no cross-record FK\n annotation as of this writing; the join is application-level.",
            "constraints": [
