        "description": "Person is one human: a user row in the reserved `people` tenant, created the\n first time an IdP token for its (provider, provider_subject) pair is seen and\n found on every login after that, from any device or browser.\n\n One provider identity is one person. A human who signs in with both Apple and\n Google is two Person rows until an explicit, both-sides-proven merge exists —\n guessing they are the same human is how accounts get hijacked.",
