            "description": "user_id is the \u003cu\u003e in /tenants/people/users/\u003cu\u003e. It is DERIVED, not minted:\n \"\u003cprovider\u003e.\u003cprovider_subject\u003e\", with the provider drawn from the closed\n enum above (neither `apple` nor `google` contains a '.', so the first dot is\n an unambiguous delimiter). The provider's subject is already stable and\n unique within that provider, so there is no hash of our own to keep\n consistent, and the same human lands on the same row without a lookup\n table.",
