{
  "name": "PersonalCredential",
  "package": "kernel",
  "description": "PersonalCredential is one key that authenticates a personal principal. It is\n a KEY, not a device: a platform-synced key presented from a phone and from an\n iPad is one credential presented twice, which is what makes those two devices\n the same principal with no sign-in (login doc §2a).",
  "fields": [
    {
