      "description": "request_text is the ask, in the requester's own words. It is UNTRUSTED\n INPUT by construction — §5: \"Ticket routing puts one person's text into\n another person's agent's context by design; that is a prompt-injection\n channel created by the feature.\" The two defences are structural and both\n apply here: authority never derives from this string (every authorisation\n in this file is an entitlement or a typed field), and it is attributed at\n the context seam — \"Joe wrote:\", never a directive.",
