          {
            "name": "source_id",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "source_id identifies the specific event. For WAKE_REASON_MESSAGE it is the\n messaging.Message's delivery_id — the record key of the one delivery this\n wake is for, not the message_id it shares with its siblings, because the\n delivery is what this consumer group consumed.",
