tools is the dog's tool list. The model is offered
   { tools here, minus needs_thumb } ∩ { rpcs the dog's delegate may call }
                                     ∩ { capability_manifest }
 fail-closed (A14, A16; ask T2). The runtime's own tools are implicit.

