          },
          {
            "name": "email",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "email and phone are AUTHORED facts in the §1 sense — \"a phone number, a\n written policy, a stated deadline — are not distilled from anything\" — so a\n write to either has to leave an artifact, which requires_artifact_on_write\n above enforces.\n\n Not (spec.assert_email): an empty string is a legitimate value here (an\n unskilled labourer who rolls up through someone else may have no address on\n file at all), and assert_email would reject it.",
            "constraints": [
