            "description": "text IS THE SOURCE OF TRUTH — \"the sentence the user said or accepted\". It\n is what the user sees, what Scotty cites, and what the model reads at\n decision time. On a GROUP it is the group's name.\n\n Everything else on this row is derived from it or is metadata about it.\n When a correction changes this sentence the handler writes a NEW node and\n sets `supersedes`, rather than overwriting, so an old citation still\n resolves to the words that were actually in force. See UpdateRule.",
