        "package": "work",
        "description": "A Task is SHARED between whoever raised it and whoever it is for (\"approve\n Tara's timesheet\" is Tara's ask and your task). That is why it lives here and\n not in Scotty's private plane. Scotty CURATES the list — decides what to\n raise, in what words, with what due — and writes it through the MCP tool\n below; the person completes it.\n A stratum record since 2026-09-25, tenant-owned and not `private`. The block\n above `message Job` is the reasoning for all six and is not repeated; the one\n thing that is specific to Task is that its no-(spec.store_principal) has TWO\n reasons rather than one — the company owns the row, AND a task has two\n parties, which is the older argument already written on `assigned_to` below.",
