          "source": "annotation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "append_aud",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "append_aud contains zero or more audience values to append to the minted\n external token's aud claim. The caller's original aud is always preserved —\n OPA may only add audiences, never replace or remove the original.\n Most policies leave this empty. Set it when the upstream requires a specific\n audience value (e.g. an OIDC client ID) in addition to\n the caller's existing aud.",
