            "type": "string",
            "description": "spiffe_id is the record's declared `owner` and the PUBLISHER — eventbus\n stamps this service's own identity onto it. The field NAME is load-bearing\n (eventbus's topic discovery matches the literal string \"spiffe_id\" of\n string type when it decides which topics get publisher-identity stamping),\n which is why it carries (spec.identity_spiffe_subject) exactly as\n work.WorkActivity.spiffe_id does.\n\n IT IS THE SERVICE, NOT A PERSON, and so it is never a read filter. Every\n row of this type in the fleet carries the same value; narrowing a read by\n it would show a reader every chat in the fleet while looking like it\n narrowed something.",
