            "description": "group, content_hash, size_bytes and content_type are what the upload\n DECLARED. The Blob row carries what actually arrived; the two are compared\n at end of stream and a mismatch fails the upload (R9 step 3).",
            "required": true,
            "constraints": [
              "maximum size: 64 bytes"
            ],
