            "name": "spiffe_id",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "spiffe_id, store_epoch_ms, namespace: the platform triple. See the\n identically-annotated fields on UserProfile for what each one is and why it\n is spelled this way — including, for `namespace`, why it is NOT a tenant's\n and why tenant_scope below is the field that answers \"which company\".",
