            "description": "TAGS 19-99 ARE FREE FOR ENVELOPE FIELDS (18 is tenant_scope, added\n 2026-09-20). An `oneof effect_params` starts at 100 the day one is\n needed — see RuleEffect's growth path. Without the gap\n the next envelope field and the first effect payload would compete for\n adjacent numbers and a reader could no longer tell the two halves apart.",
