          {
            "name": "ticket_id",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "ticket_id OPTIONALLY references the ticket this message pertains to.\n\n A dedicated field, never a value embedded in `text`. Routing and status\n display have to associate a message with its ticket to act, and the\n standing rule is that anything that must be parsed to be acted on should\n have been a field. Optional because most messages pertain to no ticket, and\n EQ-filterable because \"every message about this ticket\" is the question the\n field exists to answer.\n\n This is the ONLY ticket-shaped thing on Message, and it is an opaque id.\n Ticket's own churn — advice sealing, decision chains, amend/reconsider —\n stays entirely inside Ticket. That is what keeps this type stable.",
